&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    In the situation where multi users a create notebook, &quot;Empty Trash&quot; button next to &quot;Trash&quot; folder on Top page is not working because &quot;Empty Trash&quot; button tries to delete all notebooks in Trash folder. which includes notebook no owner and no writer permission.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    For resolving this issue, create a user folder under Trash folder, and &quot;Empty Trash&quot; button deletes all notebooks in a user folder, while &quot;Restore&quot; button restore all notebooks in a user folder.&lt;/p&gt;

